<title>USA: Harlyn Products Inc Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>Harlyn Products Inc Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>For The Quarters Ended September 30th</p>
<p>					    1996			 1995</p>
<p>				     U.S.	    U.S.  CONSOLIDATED</p>
<p> NET SALES		   $1,609,000    $2,723,000  $5,061,000</p>
<p> COST OF SALES		2,650,000     1,976,000   3,182,000</p>
<p> GROSS PROFIT	     (1,041,000)	 747,000   1,879,000</p>
<p>SELLING, GENERAL AND ADMIN.</p>
<p>   EXPENSES		   1,440,000     1,659,000   2,206,000</p>
<p> LOSS FROM OPERATIONS   (2,481,000)     (912,000)   (327,000)</p>
<p> INTEREST EXPENSE	   (359,000)     (427,000)   (563,000)</p>
<p>GAIN ON SALE OF THAILAND</p>
<p>   SUBSIDIARY		 4,289,000		--	    --</p>
<p> NET INCOME (LOSS)	  1,449,000  ( 1,339,000)  ( 890,000)</p>
<p># OF COMMON SHARES OUTSTANDING</p>
<p>				  4,910,550     4,753,284   4,753,284</p>
<p> INCOME (LOSS) PER SHARE	 0.30	 ( 0.28)     ( 0.19)</p>
<p>NOTE: on November 15th, Harlyn Products Inc completed the sale of its Thailand operations to L. L. Knickerbocker Company Inc, which sale was effective as of July 1, 1996.  Therefore, Harlyn Products Inc' results of operations for the quarter ended September 30th, 1996 include only the results of the Company's U.S. operations.</p>
